#*   Script Name:       rcd_size
#*
#*   Purpose:
#       Queries a hardcoded list of databases and their tables to get their
#       size information and stores the database results in the 
#       databases table(sizes_db) and the table results in the
#       tables table(sizes_tbl).
#*
#*   Date               : Jan 06, 1999
#*
#*   SCCS data          : @(#)
#*      Module Name     : rcd_size
#*      Version Number  : 1.2
#*      Release Number  : 1
#*      Last Updated    : 01/27/99
